# Title: HaGeZi's Multi PRO mini (best for browser/mobile ad blockers)
# Description: A size-optimized version made for DNS or browser blockers, like devices with limited RAM. This only contains domains from the full Pro list that show up on Top 1M/10M lists (Umbrella, Cloudflare, Tranco, Chrome, BuiltWith, Majestic, DomCop).
